## 3. How to Run the Project

### Running the REST API & Merchant Dashboard
```bash
py -m uvicorn api.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```
Open **`http://127.0.0.1:8000`** in your browser to access the live dashboard.

### Re-running Scripts
- Hypothesis test: `py -m src.hypothesis_test`
- Model training & tuning: `py -m src.train_models`
- Detailed evaluation & cost curves: `py -m src.evaluate`
- Test set prediction export: `py -m src.predict_test`
